# .env* and not just `.env`: the service_role key lives in .env.local, and
# what was actually keeping it out of the published snapshot was the `*.local`
# line above -- a Vite convention that happens to match. .env.production,
# .env.vercel and .env.local.bak would all have been committed and
# force-pushed to a public repo.
.env*

